  ["Data", "Reject counts, event logs, and test-pack results sent to the line PLC or quality system."],
  ["Sanitation", "Washdown rating, materials, and tool-free belt and bin removal for cleaning."],
  ["Acceptance test", "Run certified test packs at maximum line speed and confirm every one is rejected and confirmed."]
]} />
